<SCENARIO VER="105">
<TXSPN>"Yes, that is right. The rest is up to <VAR NAME="プレイヤー名" unk3="50">-sama's own efforts―"<PG>
{CHANGECG "立木三日" "グラフィック\イラスト\立木\春花用立ち絵\春花怒り.lcm" "REPEAT" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
"Wait―you idiot! As if!"<PG>
{CHANGECG "立木三日" "グラフィック\イラスト\立木\春花用立ち絵\春花通常.lcm" "REPEAT" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
"My apologies, my natural way of speaking slipped out... I retorted head-on."<PG>
"Ahem, as I think you understand, it means that yet another new arc will appear."<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
